      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Itemized Inventory &amp; GST‑Compliant Invoicing – Seamless Reimbursement for Banks &amp; Government</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">When the corporate client signed the relocation contract, the first task was to draft an **itemized inventory sheet** that would leave no doubt about every box, crate and piece of equipment being moved. Our team began by photographing each item, noting its make, model, serial number and condition, then entered the data into a standardized template—search terms like “inventory sheet template” and “detailed packing list format” guided the layout. The result was a clear, printable document that could be cross‑checked by the client’s facilities manager on the spot.

With the inventory locked, the finance desk prepared the **18% GST tax invoice**. Using the “GST invoice format” and “GST‑compliant invoice sample” guidelines, we listed every service—packing, loading, transit, unloading—and applied the statutory 18 % GST rate to the subtotal. The invoice also displayed the client’s GSTIN, our own IBA‑registered GST number, and a breakdown of taxes for easy verification. This level of detail eliminated the back‑and‑forth that usually stalls payment cycles.

The synergy between the two documents became evident during the claim reimbursement stage. For **corporate, PSU and government clients**, auditors demand proof of both the assets moved and the taxes paid. The itemized inventory sheet serves as the physical evidence, while the GST invoice provides the fiscal proof. When the client’s accounts department uploads the two PDFs into their ERP system, the claim is automatically matched against the purchase order, triggering a swift approval. In practice, we’ve seen reimbursement times drop from 30 days to under 10 days.

All of this is possible because we partner with **iba approved packers and movers in Ranchi**, a credential that reassures public‑sector buyers of compliance and quality. Searches like “IBA approved movers Ranchi” or “government‑approved relocation services” frequently lead prospective clients to our portal, where they can download the inventory and invoice templates, request a quote, and watch the entire process—from packing to claim settlement—run like a well‑oiled machine.</div>
