      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does IBA approval mean for packers and movers in Ranchi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval indicates that the mover complies with the Indian Banks Association’s stringent code of conduct, ensuring transparent pricing, verified documentation, and reliable service. For customers in Ranchi, it guarantees that Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers can process bank and government claim bills without discrepancies, providing peace of mind during relocation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I claim 100% reimbursement for my household shift through a bank or government department?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To claim full reimbursement, submit the IBA‑formatted consignment note, GST‑compliant invoice, detailed inventory sheet, and stamped money receipt. These documents, prepared by the IBA approved packers and movers in Ranchi, meet the exact requirements of banks, PSUs, and government agencies, enabling a smooth, 100% claim settlement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are included in the 7‑layer packaging for fragile items?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system combines 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, stretch film weatherproofing, and custom wooden crates for delicate goods. This multi‑layer shield absorbs shocks, prevents vibrations, and guards against moisture, ensuring safe transport of valuables during long‑haul moves.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges in the IBA relocation tariff matrix for Ranchi to other cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No. The IBA relocation tariff matrix is a transparent, item‑wise cost structure published by Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers. It lists all charges—fuel surcharge, tolls, insurance, and handling fees—so customers receive an upfront quote with no surprise fees, aligning with IBA’s consumer‑friendly standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What type of insurance coverage does Shree Ashirwad provide for interstate moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. This policy covers loss, damage, or theft of goods throughout the journey, from Ranchi to any major hub, and is included in the service package at no extra cost for IBA approved customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does GPS tracking enhance the safety of my shipment on the Ranchi‑850 km route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All fleet vehicles are equipped with satellite GPS devices that provide real‑time location updates, route monitoring, and geo‑fencing alerts. This visibility ensures that the shipment remains on the designated highway corridor, reduces the risk of diversion, and allows customers to track their belongings live.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I get a customized quote if I have special items like a piano or temple idols?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. The IBA approved packers and movers in Ranchi assess special items individually, recommend bespoke crating, and include any additional handling requirements in a tailored quote. This ensures safe transport of high‑value or culturally significant items while adhering to IBA documentation standards.</p>
      </div>
